  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo abena Israeli balongene ku Misipa, balilapile ukuti, “Takwakabe umuntu nelyo umo, uwa muli ifwe, uuli nokuufya umwana umwanakashi ku mwaume umwina Benjamini.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abantu baya ku Betele, eko baya ikala akasuba konse pa cinso cakwa Lesa mpaka icungulo. Basanswile amashiwi yabo no kulilishika ukukalamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batile, “Mwe Yawe, Lesa wa bena Israeli, bushe cinshi cabela ifi icakuti ilelo pabe uluko lumo ulushilipo ku bena Israeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulucelo pa bushiku bwakonkelepo, abantu bakuulile ubulambo, no kutuula umutuulo we lambo lyakoca no wakwampana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abena Israeli bayambile ukwipushanya abati, “Bushe ni bani abashishile kukulongana pa ba mu nko sha bena Israeli ku cilonganino icili ku cinso cakwa Yawe?” Pantu balilapile umulapo icine cine ukuti uyo onse ushakese kukulongana pa cinso cakwa Yawe ku Misipa, afwilefye ukwipaiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico nomba abena Israeli balangulukile bamunyinabo aba mu luko lwa bena Benjamini. Elyo batile, “Awe ilelo linefye uluko lumo ulwa bena Israeli naluputulwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe twalacita shani pakusanga abanakashi abakuti bakoope kuli aba abashalapo? Apo ifwe twalilapa umulapo kuli Yawe uwakuti tatwakapeele abana abakashana besu kukuupwa ku bena Benjamini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili bayambile ukwipushanya abati, “Bushe palipo umuntu umo ukufuma mu nko sha bena Israeli uushishileko kuli ici cilonganino ku cinso cakwa Yawe ku Misipa?” Elyo basangile ukuti ku ba ku Yabeshi Gileadi emushali umuntu nelyo umo uwaishile ku nkambi kukulongana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu ilyo bapendele abantu, basangile ukuti tapali umuntu nelyo umo uwa mu bekashi ba bena Yabeshi Gileadi uwalipo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico kanshi icilonganino catumine ifita amakana ikumi limo na yabili (12,000), abaswangana nganshi, no kubeba ati, “Kabiyeni ku bena Yabeshi Gileadi no kubepaya ku lupanga, ukubikakofye na banakashi pamo pene na bana bonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyo mulingile muye mucite. Muye peela umwaume onse kukonaulwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ukupeela kukonaulwa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ili shiwi mu Cihibulu lipilibula ukulubwila kuli Lesa icintu nangu umuntu ukwabula ukulapulula, ilingi line ni mukonaulwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " pamo no mwanakashi onse uushili nacisungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo baile sanga pa bekashi ba mu Yabeshi Gileadi abanakashi banacisungu imyanda ine (400) abashatala abalalapo no mwaume. Awe babasendele ku nkambi ku Shilo mu calo ca Kenani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo icilonganino catumine amashiwi yakulenga icibote pakati ka bena Benjamini abali ku cilibwe ca Rimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi abena Benjamini nabo epakubweluluka pa nshita ine ilya elyo baisa bapeela abanakashi abashelepo ilyo baipeye abantu ba ku Yabeshi Gileadi. Lelo aba abanakashi tabakumanine kuli bonse iyoo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe abantu balangulukile abena Benjamini apakalamba, pantu Yawe asha icipunda icikalamba mu nko sha bena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abakalamba ba cilonganino batile, “Calaba shani pakuti tufwaile abanakashi bakuupa ku bena Benjamini abashelepo, pantu abanakashi bonse mu bena Benjamini balipwa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili batile, “Abena Benjamini abashalapo bafwile bakwata impyani pakuti uluko lwabo lwikalobelela mu bena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ifwe tatwingapeela abana besu abanakashi mukuupwa kuli bena, apo ifwe fwe bena Israeli twalicita umulapo uwakuti, ‘Abe uwalapishiwa umuntu onse uuli nokupeela umwanakashi wakuupa ku bena Benjamini.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba moneni, kuli nokuba inshikunkulu yakwa Yawe ku Shilo, ku kapinda ka ku kuso ka Betele, kabili ku kabanga ka musebo wafuma ku Betele ukuya ku Shekemu, na ku masamba ya Lebona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili bakonkenyepo ukweba abena Benjamini abati, “Kabiyeni no kuya fisama mu mabala ya myangashi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no kulolela. Kabili ilyo abakashana ba bena Shilo baisa no kwamba ukucinda, elyo nomba na imwe mukasokoloke mu mabala ya myangashi, elyo cila umo akaikatilepo umwanakashi wakuupa pa bakashana ba bena Shilo no kuya ku calo ca bena Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ilyo bashibo nangu bandume shabo bakesa mukulailishanya kuli ifwe, tuli nokubebafye ukuti, ‘Ala tubelelenikofye uluse kabili musuminishe, pantu tatwabasendele abanakashi bakuupa ilyo twali ku bulwi. Kabili imwe mulifye abakaele pantu teimwe mwe bene mwabapeele abana benu abakashana.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi nabo abena Benjamini bacitile umo mwine baebelwe. Ilyofye abakashana bayambile ukucinda, cila umo aiketepo umo no kumusenda mukuba umukashi wakwe. Elyo babwelele na ku cifulo ca cishilano cabo no kukuula imisumba no kwikala emo balaikala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na pa nshita ilya ine, abena Israeli basalanganine na mu fifulo fyabo, cila luko no mukowa wabo baile ku fifulo fya cishilano cabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
